logseq/logseq/pulls][my PR about dark mode on Android]]\n* Make PageUp/PageDown to in [[logseq]]. They should move the cursor to the first block of the next/prev pages\n:PROPERTIES:\n:collapsed: true\n:END:\n** DONE Implement PageUp/PageDown outside of editing mode\n** DONE Implement PageUp/PageDown in editing mode\n** DONE Check if there are default commands/shortcuts I can use for home/end, pageup/pagedown\n** DONE Consider to implement all the shortcuts as a plugin\n** DONE Create `logseq-modern-nav-keys` plugin\n** DONE Improve precision for PageUp. It selects the block outside of the visible frame sometimes\n** DONE Add e2e tests for PageUp/PageDown\n** DONE Implement Shift+PageUp/PageDown outside of editing mode\n** DONE Implement Shift+PageUp/PageDown in editing mode\n** DONE Fix deselecting when the direction is changed and the number of selected items is less than per page\n** DONE Implement Home/End outside of editing mode\n** DONE Add e2e tests for Shift+PageUp/PageDown\n** DONE Add e2e test for Home/End\n** DONE Create PR for feat/page-up-down\n** DONE Fix behavior when only one block is visible on the page\n** TODO Wait for a review of my PR [[https://github.com/logseq/logseq/pull/11783][feat/page-up-down]]\n* TODO Create a [[logseq]] plugin to properly show agenda: day by day\n* TODO Make [[logseq]] to escape editing after `Delete` keyboard shortcut in case the editing wasn't activated\n* TODO Add a keyboard shortcut to go to the page with the block in [[logseq]]\n* TODO Reimplement PageUp/PageDown for [[logseq]] in a plugin\n* TODO Research the weird multi cursors edits in #zed\n* TODO Create an extension for vscode and/or zed to support Jetbrains requests file (.http file extension)\n* TODO Create modus operandi/vivendi theme for [[logseq]]\n* TODO Create a plugin for [[logseq]] to render a progressbar like in org-mode\n* TODO Create Gnome extension just like devilspie2\n* TODO Find a plugin or command in [[logseq]] to toggle showing completed todos\